So . Where was I ?

1075
01:39:15,080 --> 01:39:18,570
The communication problems between matter and antimatter .

1076
01:39:18,650 --> 01:39:21,310
Exactly . As if you were in a black hole !

1077
01:39:21,380 --> 01:39:25,220
Gravitation is so strong that nothing can escape it : absolute silence .

1078
01:39:25,290 --> 01:39:26,950
- By the way , what 's the time ? - What ?

1079
01:39:27,020 --> 01:39:28,510
What 's the time ?

1080
01:39:28,590 --> 01:39:30,080
Just after eight .

1081
01:39:30,160 --> 01:39:31,150
Already ?

1082
01:39:38,140 --> 01:39:39,300
Why ?

1083
01:39:39,370 --> 01:39:42,530
The deadline was at 9 : 00 . She had almost an hour left !

1084
01:39:42,610 --> 01:39:45,070
Firstly , it was too hard to sail like that ,

1085
01:39:45,140 --> 01:39:49,640
- and secondly , I 'm starting to get hungry . - That 's true .

1086
01:40:03,000 --> 01:40:04,990
... when Kelvin overcomes gravitation ,

1087
01:40:05,070 --> 01:40:07,400
it turns out that one universe is real ,

1088
01:40:07,470 --> 01:40:09,630
but the other is just a fiction .

1089
01:40:09,700 --> 01:40:11,070
How does that happen ?

1090
01:40:11,140 --> 01:40:14,470
What do I know ! It was a kind of model projection in cyberspace .

1091
01:40:14,540 --> 01:40:17,880
And where is your hero now ? In reality or fiction ?

1092
01:40:17,950 --> 01:40:20,440
His family is in reality and he 's in fiction .

1093
01:40:20,520 --> 01:40:23,680
- But the fiction is real , isn 't it ? - How do you mean ?

1094
01:40:23,750 --> 01:40:26,750
- Well , you see it in the film , right ? - Of course .

1095
01:40:26,820 --> 01:40:30,120
So , it 's just as real as the reality which you see likewise , right ?

1096
01:40:30,190 --> 01:40:31,320
- Crap . - Why ?

1097
01:40:59,890 --> 01:41:02,230
Is anyone awake yet ?

1098
01:41:09,340 --> 01:41:10,830
Who is it ?

1099
01:41:18,180 --> 01:41:19,340
Good morning to you .

1100
01:41:19,420 --> 01:41:21,910
Sorry to disturb you so early , but I 've come from Anna 's .

1101
01:41:21,990 --> 01:41:23,480
And ?

1102
01:41:24,820 --> 01:41:26,480
Don 't you remember me ?

1103
01:41:26,560 --> 01:41:29,220
Yesterday afternoon , on the jetty . I 'm Paul .

1104
01:41:29,290 --> 01:41:30,780
Oh , yes .

1105
01:41:32,000 --> 01:41:33,830
- Good morning . - Morning .

1106
01:41:33,900 --> 01:41:37,230
Anna sent me . We had guests arrive unexpectedly this morning ...

1107
01:41:37,300 --> 01:41:40,300
and she wonders if you could spare her a few eggs ?

1108
01:41:40,370 --> 01:41:41,860
I think so .

1109
01:41:41,940 --> 01:41:43,430
Come in .

1110
01:41:43,510 --> 01:41:45,670
Wait a minute .

1111
01:41:55,264 --> 01:42:01,689
" I Hope you Enjoyed " " Released By TuGAZx " " PTpOWeR "

1112
01:42:50,855 --> 01:42:53,102
[ ENGLISH-US \ UK ]

